To find out how the range varies for each product type, your manager has asked you to determine the minimum and maximum values for each
product type.

SOLUCION:

SELECT product_type, MIN(price) as min_price, MAX(price) as max_price
FROM public.products
Group BY product_type

Solucion 2 estandarizada:
SELECT
    COALESCE(product_type, 'Unknown') AS product_type,
    MIN(
        ROUND(
              COALESCE(
                  price::NUMERIC,
                  (SELECT PERCENTILE_CONT(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY price::NUMERIC) FROM public.products)
        )::NUMERIC, 2
      )
    ) AS min_price,
    MAX(
        ROUND(
              COALESCE(
                price::NUMERIC,
                (SELECT PERCENTILE_CONT(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY price::NUMERIC) FROM public.products)
        )::NUMERIC, 2
    )
  ) AS max_price
FROM public.products
GROUP BY COALESCE(product_type, 'Unknown');
